<title>USA: SpeedFam secures $23.6 mln in orders.</title>
<headline>SpeedFam secures $23.6 mln in orders.</headline>
<dateline>CHANDLER, Ariz. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SpeedFam International Inc said on Tuesday that since September its Auriga product has secured orders totaling $23.6 million in value.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that shipments against these orders were scheduled to begin in late 1996 and to continue through the first half of 1997.</p>
<p>Initial customer applications will involve oxide and tungsten processes for the manufacturing of memory and logic integrated circuits.</p>
</text>
